---
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const webshopPaper = 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.01206';
const webshopProject = 'https://webshop-pnlp.github.io/';
const webshopCode = 'https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop';
const impactSource = 'https://collaborate.princeton.edu/en/publications/webshop-towards-scalable-real-world-web-interaction-with-grounded/';
const seedPaper = 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.14777';
const seedCodeRoot = 'https://github.com/jinyangwu/SEED/blob/2cf2fadca3c5aba28da68e8e1405182ba8d90e6c';
const seedWebShopLauncher = `${seedCodeRoot}/examples/seed_trainer/_common/webshop.sh`;
---

<section id="webshop-reader-map" class="reader-map" aria-labelledby="webshop-reader-map-title" data-ui-audit="contrast layout overflow">
  <header class="reader-map-header">
    <div class="eyebrow">{t('先建立坐标 · READER MAP', 'ORIENT FIRST · READER MAP')}</div>
    <h2 id="webshop-reader-map-title">{t('先回答 6 个问题，再往下看细节', 'Answer six questions first, then go into the details')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '第一次来到这里，不应该先记代码、goal 编号或评测细节。先弄清楚：WebShop 是什么、为什么值得用、SEED 到底用了哪套设置。下面的机制图才有意义。',
      'A first-time reader should not begin with code, goal indices, or evaluator details. First establish what WebShop is, why it matters, and which setting SEED actually used. The mechanism figures below then have a clear purpose.'
    )}</p>
  </header>

  <section class="thirty-second" aria-label={t('30 秒看懂 WebShop', 'WebShop in 30 seconds')}>
    <article data-ui-audit-item>
      <small>WHAT</small>
      <strong>WebShop · NeurIPS 2022</strong>
      <p>{t('一个模拟电商网站 benchmark：Agent 接到自然语言购物要求后，要搜索、浏览、选择商品与选项并完成购买。', 'A simulated e-commerce benchmark where an agent must search, browse, choose products and options, and complete a purchase from a natural-language request.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article data-ui-audit-item>
      <small>SCALE</small>
      <strong>1.18M · 12,087</strong>
      <p>{t('约 118 万个真实商品，12,087 条众包购物指令。', 'About 1.18 million real-world products and 12,087 crowd-sourced shopping instructions.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article id="webshop-impact" data-ui-audit-item>
      <small>IMPACT · 2026-09-12</small>
      <strong>386 Scopus citations</strong>
      <p>{t('Princeton Research Portal 当前显示 386 次 Scopus 引用。不同数据库和日期会得到不同数字，所以这里固定来源与日期。', 'Princeton Research Portal currently reports 386 Scopus citations. Counts vary by database and date, so the source and date are pinned here.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article data-ui-audit-item>
      <small>WHY IT MATTERS</small>
      <strong>{t('不是“一问一答”，而是连续行动', 'Not one-shot QA: sequential action')}</strong>
      <p>{t('它同时考语言理解、网页导航、搜索改写、连续决策与终局评分，因此适合研究 long-horizon agent learning。', 'It combines language understanding, web navigation, query reformulation, sequential decisions, and terminal scoring, making it useful for long-horizon agent learning.')}</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <nav class="source-links" aria-label={t('WebShop 主要来源', 'Primary WebShop sources')}>
    <a href={webshopPaper} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={webshopPaper} />{t('WebShop 论文 ↗', 'WebShop paper ↗')}</a>
    <a href={webshopProject} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={webshopProject} />{t('项目主页 ↗', 'Project page ↗')}</a>
    <a href={webshopCode} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={webshopCode} />{t('官方代码 ↗', 'Official code ↗')}</a>
    <a href={impactSource} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={impactSource} />{t('引用数来源 ↗', 'Citation source ↗')}</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="question-map" aria-labelledby="question-map-title">
    <header>
      <small>TABLE OF QUESTIONS</small>
      <h3 id="question-map-title">{t('这页按什么顺序读？', 'In what order should this page be read?')}</h3>
    </header>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <a href="#fig-webshop-dataset">
          <b>01</b>
          <span><strong>{t('WebShop 是什么？', 'What is WebShop?')}</strong><small>{t('论文、规模、原始 benchmark', 'Paper, scale, original benchmark')}</small></span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#webshop-impact">
          <b>02</b>
          <span><strong>{t('它为什么重要？', 'Why does it matter?')}</strong><small>{t('影响力与为什么适合 Agent 研究', 'Impact and why it is useful for agent research')}</small></span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">↑</i>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#webshop-seed-setting">
          <b>03</b>
          <span><strong>{t('SEED 里 WebShop 怎么设置？', 'How is WebShop set up in SEED?')}</strong><small>{t('论文口径 / 公开代码 / 未知边界', 'Paper / released code / unknown boundary')}</small></span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#webshop-interaction">
          <b>04</b>
          <span><strong>{t('Agent 到底怎么玩？', 'What does the agent actually do?')}</strong><small>{t('观察 → 动作 → 页面变化 → 奖励', 'Observation → action → page transition → reward')}</small></span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#fig-webshop-small-world">
          <b>05</b>
          <span><strong>{t('原版 WebShop 怎么变成 SEED 的任务池？', 'How does original WebShop become the SEED task pool?')}</strong><small>{t('small world → goals → split', 'Small world → goals → split')}</small></span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#fig-webshop-evaluation">
          <b>06</b>
          <span><strong>{t('分数怎么来，怎样公平比较？', 'How is it scored, and what makes comparison fair?')}</strong><small>{t('Task Score / Exact Success / 同一评测合同', 'Task Score / Exact Success / same evaluation contract')}</small></span>
          <i aria-hidden="true">↓</i>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="webshop-seed-setting" class="seed-setting" aria-labelledby="webshop-seed-setting-title">
    <header class="seed-setting-header">
      <div>
        <small>SEED × WEBSHOP · SETTING AT A GLANCE</small>
        <h3 id="webshop-seed-setting-title">{t('SEED 到底用了什么 WebShop 设置？', 'What WebShop setting did SEED actually use?')}</h3>
      </div>
      <p>{t('第一原则：不要把“论文写了什么”“当前公开代码默认什么”“公开资料根本没告诉我们什么”混成一件事。', 'First principle: do not collapse what the paper reports, what the released code defaults to, and what public evidence does not tell us into one claim.')}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="evidence-lanes">
      <article class="paper-lane" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>PAPER · {t('论文口径', 'REPORTED SETTING')}</small>
        <strong>{t('论文用 WebShop 做长程交互式 Agent RL 评测', 'The paper uses WebShop for long-horizon agent RL evaluation')}</strong>
        <ul>
          <li><b>128</b> {t('个 WebShop 测试样本用于报告结果', 'WebShop test samples for reported evaluation')}</li>
          <li><b>16</b> {t('训练 batch size', 'training batch size')}</li>
          <li><b>8</b> {t('条 rollout / task（group size）', 'rollouts per task (group size)')}</li>
          <li><b>15</b> {t('步最大交互长度', 'maximum interaction steps')}</li>
          <li><b>150</b> {t('次 policy updates（论文训练日程）', 'policy updates in the paper schedule')}</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={seedPaper} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={seedPaper} />{t('打开 SEED 论文 ↗', 'Open SEED paper ↗')}</a>
      </article>

      <article class="code-lane" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>RELEASED CODE · {t('当前公开实现', 'CURRENT PUBLIC IMPLEMENTATION')}</small>
        <strong>{t('公开 launcher 把可复现的运行细节写得更具体', 'The released launcher makes runtime details more concrete')}</strong>
        <ul>
          <li><b>1,000</b> {t('个商品的 small WebShop', 'products in small WebShop')}</li>
          <li><b>6,910</b> {t('个可执行 synthetic goals', 'executable synthetic goals')}</li>
          <li><b>500–6909</b> {t('训练候选 goals', 'training-candidate goals')}</li>
          <li><b>0–499</b> {t('held-out 候选 goals', 'held-out candidate goals')}</li>
          <li><b>128</b> {t('validation size；', 'validation size; ')}<b>T=0.4</b> {t('validation sampling；', 'validation sampling; ')}<b>15</b> {t('步上限', 'step cap')}</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={seedWebShopLauncher} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={seedWebShopLauncher} />{t('打开固定版本 WebShop launcher ↗', 'Open pinned WebShop launcher ↗')}</a>
      </article>

      <article class="unknown-lane" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>UNKNOWN · {t('不能假装知道', 'DO NOT PRETEND TO KNOW')}</small>
        <strong>{t('论文最终表格背后的“具体 128 题”没有被公开唯一钉死', 'The exact 128 tasks behind the paper’s final table are not uniquely pinned publicly')}</strong>
        <p>{t('公开资料能复现“怎样抽一次 128 题验证”，但没有把论文最终结果绑定到唯一的 validation 次序、checkpoint 和 exact task manifest。所以下面页面会区分“可复现规则”和“论文最终那一次具体抽样”。', 'Public evidence can reproduce how a 128-task validation is sampled, but it does not bind the paper’s final result to one validation ordinal, checkpoint, and exact task manifest. The rest of this page therefore separates reproducible rules from the paper’s specific final realization.')}</p>
        <a href="#fig-seed-webshop">{t('看详细的公平比较边界 ↓', 'See the detailed fair-comparison boundary ↓')}</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <aside class="code-paper-note" role="note">
      <strong>{t('为什么这里不把所有数字揉成一行？', 'Why not compress every number into one row?')}</strong>
      <p>{t('因为当前 released launcher 的默认训练轮数与论文叙述的训练日程不应被自动当成同一个东西。这里优先保留“出处 + 语义”，而不是制造一个看起来整齐、实际上混淆证据层级的 setting 表。', 'Because the current released launcher defaults and the training schedule described in the paper should not automatically be treated as the same object. This overview preserves provenance and meaning instead of producing a tidy but misleading setting table.')}</p>
    </aside>
  </section>
</section>

<style>
  .reader-map{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:1.4rem auto 2.2rem;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface)}
  .reader-map-header{max-width:930px}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font:800 .66rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.reader-map-header h2{margin:.42rem 0 .65rem;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em}.reader-map-header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(.88rem,1.5vw,1rem);line-height:1.7}
  .thirty-second{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem;margin-top:1.35rem}.thirty-second article{min-width:0;padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface-muted)}.thirty-second small,.question-map>header small,.seed-setting-header small,.evidence-lanes>article>small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:800 .56rem/1.25 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.thirty-second strong{display:block;margin:.35rem 0 .45rem;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.25}.thirty-second p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.69rem;line-height:1.5}.thirty-second article:nth-child(1){border-top:4px solid var(--accent)}.thirty-second article:nth-child(3){border-top:4px solid var(--success)}
  .source-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:.75rem}.source-links a,.evidence-lanes a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;padding:.45rem .62rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;color:var(--ink);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.source-links a:hover,.source-links a:focus-visible,.evidence-lanes a:hover,.evidence-lanes a:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
  .question-map{margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1.3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.question-map>header{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}.question-map h3{margin:.3rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.5vw,1.75rem);letter-spacing:-.025em}.question-map ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem;margin:1rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}.question-map li{min-width:0}.question-map a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.65rem;align-items:center;height:100%;padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface-muted);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}.question-map a:hover,.question-map a:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 5%,var(--surface))}.question-map b{color:var(--accent);font:850 .68rem/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.question-map span{min-width:0}.question-map strong,.question-map small{display:block}.question-map strong{font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.3}.question-map small{margin-top:.22rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.62rem;line-height:1.35}.question-map i{color:var(--muted);font-style:normal;font-weight:900}
  .seed-setting{margin-top:1.5rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-muted);scroll-margin-top:5rem}.seed-setting-header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:1.2rem;align-items:end}.seed-setting-header h3{margin:.3rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.6vw,1.9rem);letter-spacing:-.03em}.seed-setting-header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.6}.evidence-lanes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem;margin-top:1rem}.evidence-lanes>article{display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface)}.evidence-lanes>article>strong{display:block;margin:.4rem 0 .7rem;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.35}.evidence-lanes ul{display:grid;gap:.42rem;margin:0 0 .8rem;padding:0;list-style:none}.evidence-lanes li{padding-top:.42rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.45}.evidence-lanes li b{color:var(--ink)}.evidence-lanes p{margin:0 0 .8rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.69rem;line-height:1.55}.evidence-lanes a{margin-top:auto;align-self:flex-start}.paper-lane{border-top:4px solid var(--success)!important}.code-lane{border-top:4px solid var(--accent)!important}.unknown-lane{border-top:4px solid var(--warning)!important}.code-paper-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(190px,.7fr) minmax(0,1.3fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:.7rem;padding:.8rem;border-left:4px solid var(--warning);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;background:var(--surface)}.code-paper-note strong{font-size:.76rem}.code-paper-note p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.69rem;line-height:1.55}
  #webshop-impact{scroll-margin-top:5rem}
  @media(max-width:900px){.thirty-second{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.question-map ol{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.seed-setting-header,.evidence-lanes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.code-paper-note{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.reader-map{width:min(100% - 1rem,1120px);padding:1rem}.thirty-second,.question-map ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.source-links{display:grid}.source-links a{justify-content:flex-start}.question-map>header{display:block}}
</style>
